{
  "run_id": "PMC11355469__scimon__text_64k_b_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Copper has excellent thermal and electrical properties.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Copper has relatively low wear resistance.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Copper has poor surface oxidation protection.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Depositing an HEA coating on copper will improve its wear resistance and surface protection compared with uncoated copper.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "AlCoCrFeNi or a similar refractory or eutectic HEA can form an adherent coating on a copper substrate.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Laser cladding, sputtering, or additive manufacturing are appropriate methods for depositing the proposed HEA coating on copper.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "HEAs can possess FCC, BCC, or multiphase solid-solution microstructures.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9",
        "PMC7513042::chunk::000::abstract::b55c769615"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA coating on copper will develop into a hard, wear-resistant layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature exposure of the proposed coating will form protective Al2O3 or Cr2O3 surface species.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The surface oxides will improve both coating adhesion and surface protection.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A hard HEA layer can act as a mechanical barrier that reduces abrasive material removal.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lattice distortion and sluggish diffusion contribute to the superior hardness and wear resistance of HEAs.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "HEAs can exhibit intrinsic oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9",
        "PMC7513042::chunk::000::abstract::b55c769615"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed HEA will form a self-healing oxide film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film will protect the underlying copper from corrosive and high-temperature environments.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "HEA-coated copper will have a significantly lower wear rate than uncoated copper.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "HEA-coated copper will have greater oxidation resistance than uncoated copper.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9",
        "PMC7513042::chunk::000::abstract::b55c769615"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will extend copper's service life in friction-intensive or high-temperature applications.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coating effectiveness depends on deposition parameters, interfacial bonding, and adhesion quality.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermal-expansion mismatch, extreme thermal cycling, or high mechanical stress can cause delamination or microcracking of the HEA coating on copper.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
  ],
